fib-abia-planners
=============

A distribution of the planners FF 2.3 and Metric-FF 2.1 by Jörg Hoffmann, with
the planning examples of the ABIA course (Universitat Politècnica de Catalunya).

The whole distribution is licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 2 or (at your option) any later version. The full text is in LICENSE.

Components
----------

* FF 2.3 and Metric-FF 2.1 (src/ff, src/metric-ff)
  Copyright (C) 2001/2002 Albert Ludwigs University Freiburg, Institute of
  Computer Science (Jörg Hoffmann). GPL version 2 or later. FF 2.3 also carries
  the JAIR "AS IS" disclaimer in its source headers. Modifications made by this
  project are listed in PATCHES.md; the pristine sources are in upstream/.

* Portability layer, Python launcher, test harness and tools
  (src/compat, python/abia_planners, harness, tools)
  Copyright (C) 2026 abia-planners contributors. GPL version 2 or later.

* Course examples (examples/)
  ABIA course material (UPC). Includes domains from the International Planning
  Competition (Logistics, Miconic, Rovers) and the Towers of Hanoi formalisation
  by Héctor Geffner. Distributed for academic use; see examples/SOURCES.md.

The plan validator VAL (BSD-3-Clause, University of Strathclyde, King's College
London and Schlumberger Ltd) is used only in tests and is not distributed.

Source code
-----------

The corresponding source code of every binary in this distribution is the
source distribution (sdist) of the same version on PyPI, and the project
repository.
